## 💻 3. Technical & Engineering Architecture

### Component Hierarchy
- **`header.ic-header-worldclass`**: Floating header shell with auto-hiding / compact scroll physics.
- **`.ic-brand-hub`**: Brand logo SVG + typography + version tag.
- **`.ic-nav-island`**: Navigation menu container with magnetic sliding indicator.
  - **`.ic-nav-item`** (with `.has-dropdown`):
    - **`.ic-nav-trigger`**: Top-level link with chevron micro-animation (`transform: rotate(180deg)`).
    - **`.ic-mega-dropdown`**: Frosted glass card containing 2-column or 3-column feature grid with icons, titles, badges, and descriptions.
- **`.ic-action-matrix`**:
  - **`.ic-telemetry-hud-btn`**: Live VRAM telemetry pill with popover stats drawer.
  - **`.ic-search-trigger`**: Shortcut trigger with `kbd` pill.
  - **`.ic-btn-studio`**: Shimmering primary CTA.
  - **`.ic-mobile-hamburger`**: Micro-animated 3-line hamburger morphing to 'X'.
- **`.ic-mobile-drawer`**: Full-screen slide-down glass drawer with accordions for mobile/tablet viewports (<1100px).

