1. **Visual Quality & Spacing Audit**:
   - Verify layout on 4K, 1440p, 1080p, 1366x768 (laptop), tablet (768px), and mobile (375px) viewports to guarantee **zero text crowding**.
2. **Interaction & Animation Checks**:
   - Verify smooth 60fps magnetic hover pill tracking.
   - Verify mega dropdown entrance/exit transition without flickering or awkward clipping.
   - Verify telemetry popover opens cleanly on click/hover.
3. **Browser Testing & Screenshot Capture**:
   - Open updated pages in local preview and capture high-resolution screenshots to verify world-class visual aesthetics.
4. **Cross-Page Link Consistency**:
   - Ensure every dropdown link accurately routes to the corresponding page and deep anchor tags.
